  "question": "If $$A=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 \\\\ 3 & 4\\end{bmatrix},\\quad B=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 2\\end{bmatrix},$$ find $2A-3B$.",
